fish-bluespace-instructions-harvester = Connect the anchored harvester to a high-voltage cable. Each batch costs 60 MJ of received energy. Keep a clear output tile 2–3 tiles away. Overdrive raises the background faster; at high levels local incursions may occur. A critical background shuts down the machine.
fish-bluespace-instructions-prober = Connect this device to the APC network and a powered research server on the same station. It consumes 25 kW and raises the background while generating research. Multiple probers have diminishing returns. A critical background shuts down research probers.
fish-bluespace-instructions-suppressor = Connect this device to the APC network. It consumes 50 kW while lowering the station's background and remains available during an emergency shutdown.
fish-bluespace-warning-source = Bluespace monitoring
fish-bluespace-warning = Bluespace background has reached { $level }. Reduce production or activate suppressors.
fish-bluespace-danger = Dangerous bluespace background: { $level }. Local instability and harvester incursions are possible.
fish-bluespace-critical = Critical bluespace background: { $level }. Research probers and harvesters are shutting down. Use suppressors and reduce the background below 80 before restarting.
